   "context": "MainWindow",
   "source": "<html>\n<body>\n<p>Here you'll see information about currently installed and available Linux kernels.</p>\n<p>You can install and/or uninstall kernel packages using the checkboxes on the leftmost column.</p>\n<p>This app won't work, if you are already running a pacman instance.</p>\n</body>\n</html>",
